# Start the TUI inside a catalogue, search, move through the hits, change the layout, open the help.
Sleep 800ms
Type "okf tui"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "bread"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot results
Type "j"
Sleep 1200ms
Type "j"
Sleep 1200ms
Type "v"
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot list-only
Type "v"
Sleep 1500ms
Type "V"
Sleep 1500ms
Type "?"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot help
Escape
Sleep 1s
